WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:08.650
We're fighting right now in the galaxy soccer tournament, Grand Celesta Galaxy.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:12.240
Our first opponent is the planet Sandorias.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.160
We continue to fight as we aim to be best in the universe.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.340
Let's go!

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:29.880
Okay, one more!

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:33.380
That's good! Keep it up!

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.060
This is so hard to work with.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.530
You'll get used to it soon.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.510
Let's go!

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.020
Sakura!

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:45.120
Okay!

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.940
You kicked too far!

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.710
What are you doing?

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:54.000
Kick properly!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.530
My foot got stuck, I can't help it!

00:00:58.060 --> 00:00:58.780
He got through me!

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.580
He's coming your way, Manabe-kun!

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.040
32 degrees from the left!

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:06.040
I'll stop it!

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:10.090
Shoot, Matatagi!

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.340
Nice reaction.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:19.510
I almost had it.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.570
You ought to have cleared that one!

00:01:22.570 --> 00:01:24.840
My estimation fell a bit short, that was all.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:28.460
But if this was a real match, you would have made a fatal error!

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:31.770
What about you, then? Zanakurou-kun shook you off his tail easily!

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:35.010
I hate this...

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:38.030
They're all wearing such scary faces...

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:43.680
Yeah.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:46.620
But the fate of Earth is at stake.

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:48.180
We're all feeling the pressure.

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:51.760
It's game day tomorrow.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:53.960
Yeah.

00:03:54.370 --> 00:03:55.670
Who are you?

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.230
Wait!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.450
It's so pretty.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:38.380
Piku.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.340
Stop, that tickles!

00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:53.030
That was...

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.900
What a strange dream.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.980
W-What is this thing?

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.340
H-H-Hey!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.760
W-Wait!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:14.620
What's going on?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:19.940
Don't run away.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.550
There's nothing to be scared about.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:26.780
Good morning, every-

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.930
Who's this? It's so cute!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:37.110
Is it a dog? Or a cat?

00:05:37.110 --> 00:05:39.650
I'm pretty sure it's neither...

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.670
Hey, where did it come from?

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.400
It was in my room when I woke up.

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:54.870
Is it a creature from this planet?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:57.040
I don't know.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.710
So? How did it get in here?

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:08.680
My dream...

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.970
It's the same as the creature I saw in my dream.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:15.970
So you're saying it came out of your dream?

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.270
No, don't!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:18.890
That's impossible!

00:06:19.130 --> 00:06:20.880
Is it?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.230
I don't think it's impossible for even the strangest things to happen.

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:25.860
I mean, look at us!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:26.940
We're in space!

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:28.880
How very interesting!

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:33.370
So this means that space has wonders that surpass even our imaginations.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:36.320
A creature that materialized from a dream, huh?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:39.170
It's like a little fairy.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.500
Then it must be a space fairy.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.670
Hey, why don't we give it a name?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.860
A name, huh?

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:49.300
How about Sandorias Dream Beast?

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:53.420
Oh, come on. That's such a long name, and it's not cute.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:06:56.520
Then how about we use the meaning for "fairy" and call it Pixie?

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.570
Pixie...

00:06:58.570 --> 00:07:00.060
Pixie, is it? {i keep writing Pixiv halp}

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.190
Yeah, I like that one!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:03.710
That's it, then.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:04.770
Pixie it is.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.670
Pixie, huh?

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:08.540
It's nice to meet you, Pixie.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.780
H-Hey, wait!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.430
Come down...

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:18.700
Looks like Pixie likes you, Tenma.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:22.560
You'll be responsible for taking care of it then, Tenma.

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.500
M-Me?

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:31.280
This day has come at last.

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.380
Yeah.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:41.100
The time for our Sandorias to be tested, on whether or not we are acceptable to continue living in this galaxy.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.320
Kazelma!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:45.940
You're here.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:49.190
I swear on my pride as a Sandorian.

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.820
We will fight this match fair and square.

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:53.880
Of course!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.160
Weak!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:08:00.200
You're as weak as the smell of flowers in the early afternoon, Kazelma! {what the heck kind of poetry is this}

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:02.020
Barga!

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.670
In a battle, you win or you lose!

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:14.240
I don't care whether Falam Orbius sent him to us or not, someone like him who doesn't match our style is just...

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.680
But his power is the real thing.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.390
He looks different from the other players.

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.850
Yeah. He doesn't look like he's from this planet.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:31.620
There is no rule in the tournament that says you cannot add inhabitants of other planets onto your team. {"他の星の人間"...人間 they say... 人間...}

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.130
If both members of different planets consent, then it is allowed.

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:36.380
What?

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.870
So he's helping them.

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:48.250
You guys are representing that nameless planet you call Earth, eh?

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:54.000
Do you honestly expect the puniest planet from the galaxy border likes yours can defeat us?

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:55.590
You won't know unless we try!

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:58.750
Just shut up and let yourselves die.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:01.970
You've got strange tastes for coming all this way for a beating. {is he calling them M}

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:02.980
What?!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:06.670
If you wanna run away crying, now's your chance.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:09.110
Why, you...!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.400
Stop!

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.060
Stop provoking them.

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.650
You're just here to help us.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:20.510
I'm here on the order of Falam Orbius's queen.

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.670
I do what I want.

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:26.830
I'll make you guys win, so you shouldn't be complaining.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:43.060
Yeah! Welcome to the cosmic soccer world!

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:52.120
Everybody! The glorious Grand Celesta Galaxy has now opened!

00:09:55.260 --> 00:10:01.120
I, the super commentator Ducksgun Babyu, is here to bring you the commentary! {ダクスガン・バービュー}

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:07.900
The first match of glory will be fought by the representatives of this planet, the Sandorias Eleven!

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:12.020
Got that?

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:15.300
Impress me here and I'll make you close associates of the Queen.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:19.440
You got it. We'll crush those Earthlings to pieces.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.650
Sir! Victory shall be ours!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.020
Easy-peasy.

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.060
That's right.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.730
That's what I wanna hear.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:32.730
They're falling over themselves to be Barga's henchmen.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:36.740
The others still look unsure as to how to act.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:45.360
And, the opponent team will be the representatives of Earth who has won Galaxy Region A-Block's prelims, Earth Eleven!

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:55.030
Let's go!

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.940
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:07.980
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:13.030
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.110
Hey, men!

00:11:16.170 --> 00:11:23.910
Here it unfolds, the melting pot of hope, despair, and excitement that involves the entire universe, Grand Celesta Galaxy!

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:29.260
The soccer tournament of all time where the lives of planets and species are at risk!

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:34.460
Who will win its first game, Earth or Sandorias?!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.420
Check it out!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:41.510
Coach Kuroiwa's orders...

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:44.620
We're using three forwards today.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.470
Matsukaze, join the forwards.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:49.180
But that will leave a space open midfield!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.710
Go.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.020
Yes, sir!

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.230
We can't afford to lose. No matter what the cost.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:07.450
Yay! There's the fated kickoff!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.370
Over here!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:10.500
Tenma!

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.170
The distance is still pretty wide.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.590
The ball won't roll very well either.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:21.590
You won't get past me!

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.390
Z Slash!

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:31.640
You're not getting through!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.920
Rock Hammer!

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:41.530
Oh! It's Barga's hissatsu technique, Rock Hammer!

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:43.450
He steals the ball from Matsukaze!

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:47.490
Is that all you've got, Earthling?

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:48.910
What a laugh!

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:52.950
I'll stop you!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.410
Not likely!

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.790
He's fast! Even on sand!

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:00.050
Gara!

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.960
He missed the pass! Morimura-san, grab it!

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:03.840
Okay!

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:05.590
You're wrong there.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.760
Whoa! An unbelievable high jump!

00:13:09.950 --> 00:13:10.760
No way!

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.310
So he <i>is</i>  coming this way.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:15.940
Gara! Do it!

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.240
Minaho is unable to respond!

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:27.950
That guy...!

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.000
There's Gara's sandstorm again!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.040
It's mine!

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.070
Don't count on it!

00:13:39.570 --> 00:13:42.840
Whoa! A nice save by Ibuki!

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:48.660
Those guys are able to see within sandstorms.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.100
But that's unfair!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:03.650
Footwork Draw!

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:06.190
Captain!

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.700
Takura! Daf! Go! {タクラ　ダフ}

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.670
You're not getting through.

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:16.080
Sorry about this.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:25.180
Barga! Stop making them do cowardly deeds!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:29.170
I told you, you either win or lose in a battle.

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:30.390
By any means necessary.

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.970
We can win without having to resort to such cowardice!

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:41.010
Very well then. I'll give you time.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:45.650
I apologize for that.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.490
I won't allow there to be such plays as before.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:51.340
Kazelma...

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:52.950
Okay.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.650
Now it's getting interesting.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:05.870
It's mine!

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:16.560
With Tenma at the frontline, they're aiming for the empty spot he's left open!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.100
Leave this to me!

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.860
Ibuki blocks it!

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:28.950
Those guys are familiar with fighting on sandy soil.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:33.100
What's more, we haven't grown accustomed yet to this planet's gravity.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.950
Frankly, we're at a disadvantage.

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:36.160
Shindou!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.160
I've got it!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.460
Kusaka, pass to Nozaki!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.580
Kick lightly!

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.350
Lightly? But she's on the other side!

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.300
Hurry!

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:48.590
Nozaki!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:53.180
I see! The ball flies wide here!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.720
Captain!

00:15:58.970 --> 00:15:59.680
Tsurugi!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.980
Bicycle Sword!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.450
Sand Knock!

00:16:16.060 --> 00:16:20.700
Wow! Goalkeeper Badai knocks away Tsurugi's shoot!

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.210
Go, Kazelma!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:31.130
What?!

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:32.880
Acker!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:33.880
No!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.010
Too late!

00:16:36.240 --> 00:16:36.720
Here he comes.

00:16:38.620 --> 00:16:39.100
Sharu!

00:16:42.570 --> 00:16:43.390
I won't let you!

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:50.280
Defense Equation!

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.060
Manabe clears it!

00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:00.870
No, wait! Defender Gobira has moved up!

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:01.830
No way!

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:09.960
Yes! Nice save!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.580
Ibuki has amazing reflexes!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.810
All right!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:26.020
That's it! Go get 'em!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.730
Take down those Earthlings!

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:32.410
At this rate, their offense will pull us down...

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.570
There has to be a breach somewhere.

00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:38.990
I can't use God's Baton!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:43.500
Whoa! Kazelma steals the ball from Shindou!

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:44.780
Acker!

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:48.250
Leaf Roll!

00:17:52.640 --> 00:17:54.550
Acker approaches the goal!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:55.970
I won't let you score!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:59.660
Great! A close blow!

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.220
Matsukaze covers and saves his team from a pinch!

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.510
Keep calm, everyone!

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:08.350
Cover each other!

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.730
Trust your teammates!

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:19.280
Sandorias!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:20.530
Sakura!

00:18:21.420 --> 00:18:23.400
Gobira steals the ball!

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.860
Sandorias goes into offense once again!

00:18:25.860 --> 00:18:26.500
Kazelma!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:31.070
I'll stop you!

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:36.590
Wonder Trap!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.080
Whoa!

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:42.800
Now, that was brilliant! Matsukaze takes back the ball!

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:46.620
You still haven't won a point against these lowlife Earthlings?

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:48.100
I've reached the end of my patience!

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:56.320
Zaba! Gara! Go!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.700
Let's do it!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:02.620
Prepare yourselves!

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.370
What?

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:10.670
Zaba!

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:13.790
Just as I calculated!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.250
So what!

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.430
Dig Through!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:21.300
What?!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.180
Yay, it's in!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:30.540
Sandorias makes the first goal!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.440
Damn it!

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:34.730
That can't be!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.980
They can dig underneath the sand? No one can block against that!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:46.160
Nozaki-san!

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:49.300
Outta the way!

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.570
What are you doing?

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:59.420
I can't see through sand! It's not my fault!

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:24.280
So fragile!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:27.630
You're as fragile as flower petals scattering off their buds!

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:31.410
Weak Earthlings like you have no hope for survival!

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.020
Stop that!

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:34.420
Even if we win through these methods-

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.570
That's why I say you're weak, Kazelma.

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:37.130
What?

00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.000
Listen up.

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:45.340
If you lose, millions of your fellow Sandorians and this planet will perish.

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:52.150
Your team is responsible for its fate.

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:57.900
If you want to survive, shouldn't you be more concerned about doing whatever it takes to win?

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:08.550
Hey, hey, hey!

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:12.060
The Earth Eleven are battered and bruised from Sandorias's rough plays!

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.680
There's no telling how this match will end!

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.750
Until time is up...

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.540
Don't miss it!

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:57.910
Passionate feelings awaken with our desire to protect!

00:22:57.910 --> 00:23:00.190
Who will unleash the power lurking within them?

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:02.690
The beast that finally appears is...

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:04.660
Next, A Soul Appears!

00:23:04.660 --> 00:23:06.860
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:19.470
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:25.980
It's not impossible for even the strangest things to happen. This is space!

00:23:26.310 --> 00:23:27.250
That's all!
